
Set raFS$SrcDir <Obey$Dir>
Set raFS$Dir <Obey$Dir>.!raFS
Set raFS$LogDir <Obey$Dir>
Set Lib$Path <Obey$Dir>.Lib.

| Recommended if developing
|Configure ADFSBuffers 0

|SetEval raFS$UseRMA 1
Unset raFS$UseRMA

| often manages to flush log before machine freezes
RMEnsure FlushLogOnError 0.00 RMLoad <raFS$SrcDir>.FlushLog 

WimpTask ChangeDynamicArea -SpriteSize 512k

| Murphy's Law states that the number of bugs (n_bugs) still remaining in
| this program is:
|            t_write · u_data · n_p²     s_log 
|  n_bugs = ------------------------- - ------- + M
|             t_debug · u_bugreport      s_src
| where:
|  t_debug     = time spent on debugging
|  t_write     = time spent on writing new parts of the program
|  n_p         = nr of partnerships of programmer while he wrote this
|  u_data      = number of users that will trust important data to the FS
|  u_bugreport = number of users that will send me bug reports
|  s_log       = maximum logfile size reached (current record ~30MB)
|  s_src       = size of source code
|  M           = "Murphy's constant" (= sin(t) + 1 )
